      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IDEOLOGY (5) took control and never looked back when winning over 2230m here last start, building on an excellent second when resuming. He meets a similar field and should get another chance to dictate, making him the one to beat. NO REMORSE (2) finally got the win he deserved at Port Pirie last time, scoring by 2.75 metres, and the favourable draw is a major advantage. He looks the main danger to the top pick. TINEY (3) has been racing consistently and comes off a sound fourth over this track and trip. A return to his best would see him right in the finish. TRANQUIL BILL (4) has been holding his form well and wasn't disgraced when fifth here last time. He can sneak into the placings at some value in a modest field.",
